  "description": "Conquer every peak – and charge full speed into the valley. The HAIBIKE ALLMTN 6 is your key to limitless mountain fun – both uphill and downhill. An uncompromising eFully that feels just as at home on flowing trails as it does on rough terrain. The powerful Bosch Performance Line CX motor and the sophisticated all-mountain frame platform help you climb the steepest gradients with ease. On the descents, 160mm travel at the front, 150mm at the rear, grippy Continental knobbly tyres and an agile mullet wheel mix deliver high-level control and riding enjoyment. The precise Shimano disc brakes give you confidence when it matters. And with the long-lasting 800Wh battery plus an optional range extender, your adventures know no limits. The perfect conditions for peak-to-valley riding pleasure. Everywhere.",
